<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 flex flex-col min-h-screen text-gray-800">

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wide">UserSystem</a>
            <div class="space-x-4">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium">Home</a>
                <a href="/users" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium">Users Management</a>
                <a href="/about" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium border-b-2 border-white pb-1">About</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-indigo-200 font-medium">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md p-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tentang Aplikasi</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Aplikasi User Management System ini dibangun menggunakan Node.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL, dan EJS Template Engine. Aplikasi ini mengimplementasikan fitur CRUD dasar (Create, Read, Update, Delete) dilengkapi dengan validasi input dan integrasi database PostgreSQL.
            </p>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-2">Teknologi yang Digunakan:</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-1">
                <li>Express.js (Backend Framework)</li>
                <li>PostgreSQL (Database)</li>
                <li>EJS (Template Engine)</li>
                <li>Tailwind CSS (Styling)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 py-6 text-center text-sm">
        &copy; 2026 User Management System. All rights reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
